\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Every near-sole-labeler exit the corrected panel observes, with what the public record establishes about its cause and its replacement ratio. Classes are ordered by how well the cause is established, not by whether it is a supply failure. Markets are named by ingredient and route-and-form bucket. Firm names are the current FDA labeler name for the NDC labeler code, not necessarily the corporate entity that held the code at the time of the exit: a code can outlive a merger, so a 2018 exit may display a name created later. The classification is keyed on the code, the market and the quarter, never on the displayed name.}}{20}{table.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:cause}{{6}{20}{Every near-sole-labeler exit the corrected panel observes, with what the public record establishes about its cause and its replacement ratio. Classes are ordered by how well the cause is established, not by whether it is a supply failure. Markets are named by ingredient and route-and-form bucket. Firm names are the current FDA labeler name for the NDC labeler code, not necessarily the corporate entity that held the code at the time of the exit: a code can outlive a merger, so a 2018 exit may display a name created later. The classification is keyed on the code, the market and the quarter, never on the displayed name}{table.6}{}}
